		{"id":"uncertainty","type":"text","text":"### Uncertainty\n\n- A single autonomic measurement has weak interpretive power\n- Transmitter names do not map to moods\n- Cortisol is one signal among many","x":0,"y":609,"width":460,"height":183,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"hypothesis","type":"text","text":"### Open questions\n\n- How do volume transmission and glial signalling complicate the synaptic model?\n- Which dopamine measurements distinguish pathway-specific effects in humans?\n- How well do animal arousal findings transfer to human cognition?","x":0,"y":852,"width":460,"height":232,"color":"6"},
